        "biography": "Anthony Tittanegro is a Partner and Executive Managing Director at Domain Capital.\n\nHe joined Domain in 2010. Before his tenure at Domain, Anthony founded and operated Titan Property Group, a boutique real estate investment and development firm. He also spent 11 years with PricewaterhouseCoopers (PwC) in their Real Estate Advisory practice, and six years in service with Prudential.\n\nIn addition to his professional pursuits, Anthony is a member of the Counsellors of Real Estate Organisation and serves on the Board of Directors of Midcap Financial, a speciality finance company with approximately $40 billion in assets under management. He completed his B.S. in Business Finance at the Florida Institute of Technology. He earned his master\u2019s degree from New York University.",
